        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This relaxing idle <strong>city builder</strong> lets you create the city of your dreams, with a cartoonish touch focused on the interaction of its inhabitants, making your city feel truly alive. Perfect if you’re tired of static, gray, hyper-realistic megapolis.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Like in other games of the genre, you can construct <strong>buildings</strong> and <strong>roads</strong>, always keeping in mind that <strong>money</strong> is your main limiting resource.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3411920/extras/0c851a767c1b4841d5c79af9c816dc55.poster.avif?t=1759334464\" width=600 height=154 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3411920/extras/0c851a767c1b4841d5c79af9c816dc55.webm?t=1759334464\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3411920/extras/0c851a767c1b4841d5c79af9c816dc55.mp4?t=1759334464\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a good mayor, you must provide for your citizens needs: <u>food</u>, <u>health</u>, <u>energy</u>, <u>security</u>, <u>goods</u>, and <u>sanitation</u>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3411920/extras/56072b5ed98ad1ff6458aebee0aecf68.poster.avif?t=1759334464\" width=600 height=154 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3411920/extras/56072b5ed98ad1ff6458aebee0aecf68.webm?t=1759334464\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3411920/extras/56072b5ed98ad1ff6458aebee0aecf68.mp4?t=1759334464\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At the beginning, you’ll only have a handful of houses. Progress will <strong>unlock more buildings</strong>, collectible characters, and <strong>achievements</strong> that add challenges, collect them all and you’ll earn a special <strong>reward</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3411920/extras/756ad3803921984eebeecb95882f4442.poster.avif?t=1759334464\" width=600 height=154 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3411920/extras/756ad3803921984eebeecb95882f4442.webm?t=1759334464\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3411920/extras/756ad3803921984eebeecb95882f4442.mp4?t=1759334464\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beyond internal chaos, your city will also face strange and chaotic events: <strong>aliens</strong>, <strong>robberies</strong>, <strong>epidemics</strong>, <strong>zombies</strong>, and much more. Prepare your city to withstand them!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3411920/extras/3f2bffcc5d9899db41e251db36d83323.poster.avif?t=1759334464\" width=600 height=154 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3411920/extras/3f2bffcc5d9899db41e251db36d83323.webm?t=1759334464\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3411920/extras/3f2bffcc5d9899db41e251db36d83323.mp4?t=1759334464\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>4 biomes:</strong> plains, desert, snowy, and rocky.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>56</strong> <strong>unlockable</strong> <strong>buildings</strong> to discover.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>5 resources:</strong> money, energy, food, minerals, and goods (import/export).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>84 collectible</strong> <strong>characters</strong> with unique behaviors.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>4 socioeconomic classes:</strong> poor, middle, burgher, and rich.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>13 citizen types</strong> (the game distinguishes between citizens and workers).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>20 special and bizarre events,</strong> including zombies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>9 flying machines</strong> to connect your city to the world.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>8 deities/religions</strong> to choose from.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>7 scientific researches</strong> with varied effects.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>8 political alignments</strong> that influence social dynamics.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>6 protests:</strong> food, goods, energy, health, security, and sanitation.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>7 massive events</strong> where citizens gather in crowds.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>9 unlockable cheats</strong> to play in god mode.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>30 achievements</strong> that challenge you and unlock cheats.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>24 slots</strong> on the world map to save your games.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>4 music stations/genres:</strong> rock, pop, latin, jazz.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>4 animals, reforesting forests, rain, </strong>and <strong>hurricanes.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>4 diseases, hunger, socialization, violence, </strong>and <strong>reproduction.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>4 types of criminals:</strong> thief, psychopath, terrorist, and mafioso.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>3 life stages:</strong> childhood, adulthood, and old age.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>1 urban transport system</strong> and <strong>roads</strong> as grid-based graphs.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>6 automatic camera modes</strong> for relaxed city viewing.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Various administrative actions,</strong> like commanding workers.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Daily and yearly graphs</strong> to view diverse statistics.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Save screenshots</strong> of your whole city or the screen.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tutorial book, keyboard shortcuts, </strong>and <strong>tooltips.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>7 languages:</strong> English, Spanish, German, French, Italian, Portuguese, and Dutch.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Notes</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Although it looks like a realistic simulation, it’s actually closer to the <strong>logic of board games</strong>. For example, each house generates an exact number of inhabitants rather than relying on a life-and-death cycle.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a <strong>relaxing sandbox</strong>: you won’t lose if you go grab a sandwich while your citizens protest. The fun is in unlocking and discovering more options that expand your creative freedom.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Original languages are <strong>English </strong>and <strong>Spanish,</strong> the rest were translated automatically.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Although it’s not in Early Access, since it’s already a <strong>mature product</strong>, feel free to suggest improvements or report any potential bugs on the <strong>Discord</strong> server.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a remake of <strong>Omicrocity 1</strong>, originally created in 2016. That version can still be played for free, although it has many design flaws.</p></li></ul>",
